If you are in no hurry, complete Sokoban before using the wish.  If
the "oR is on the top level, you will have one of the important
intrinsics covered.  Reflection and magic resistance are both must
haves, and important enough that conveniently available redundancy
makes sense as long as it doesn't eliminate anything important.

So amulet of reflection and SDSM makes some amount of sense if you
chose a [oMR and usually wield Magicbane once you receive it.  But
for a wizard a robe is nice for the spell benefits.  So you're down
to chosing which redundancy to eliminate.  That means GDSM plus "oR
plus Magicbane giving usually redundant MR, or similar variations.

So either dragon mail after you think it over.

